---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <Nav />
  <div id="me">
    <p>
      I started my career in web development in <strong>2011</strong>. Today, I’m a
      Senior Software Engineer at <strong>Itaú Unibanco</strong>, working with the
      Coreweb team to evolve the app’s transition to webviews and build the
      internal framework for the company’s web projects. I help teams adopt it
      through hands-on work and presentations. The framework will support the
      migration of more than <strong>700 experiences</strong>, helping deliver
      digital products to nearly <strong>100 million Brazilians</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before Itaú, I was a Senior Software Engineer at <strong>Arcotech</strong>,
      contributing to a dynamic homepage designed to reach one in every three
      online students in Brazil, as well as the modernization of back-office
      systems.
    </p>
    <p>
      At <strong>Grover</strong>, I worked across the e-commerce experience,
      React Native app, analytics integrations, and data operations.
    </p>
    <p>
      At <strong>Descomplica</strong>, I grew from Senior Full Stack Developer to
      Tech Manager, leading a team of 3–5 engineers. I helped launch Gabarito Enem,
      contributing to a <strong>76% year-over-year increase in leads</strong>, and
      improved the page’s organic traffic by <strong>123%</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  #me {
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
</style>
